/*
  FeatureToggles.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0205 · FeatureToggles (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  FeatureToggles resolves (table "FeatureToggles") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  Localizable.xcstrings master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first block is the exact key set extracted from the web source
  (features/settings/components/FeatureToggles.tsx, namespace `settings`). The
  remaining keys back the native-only chrome (freshness chip, stale/offline
  banners, loading / error copy) and the accessibility labels.
*/

